  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"http://discord.gg/a74pzUw2Gw\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/838480622153367682?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"187\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_In_One/BH_AL_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\"> </strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_In_One/BH_AL_ABOUT.png\" alt=\"\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>All in one&nbsp;</strong>是一款模组化 One Block 整合包，包含12个不同的阶段：&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>平地 (Flatland)</strong>。泥土、草方块、树叶……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>农田 (Farmland)</strong>。来自<strong>幸福农场 (Farmer's Delight)</strong>的各类方块、小麦块、南瓜、西瓜……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>地下 (Underground)</strong>。你能在主世界找到的矿石、主世界的敌对生物……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>主世界 (Overworld)</strong>。以上阶段的混合体 + 更多主世界内容。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>星辉 (Astral)</strong>。基于<strong>星辉魔法 (Astral Sorcery)</strong>的阶段。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>魔导 (Magicka)</strong>。基于<strong>新艺术魔法 (Ars Nouveau)</strong>的阶段。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>魔法合集 (MagicBundle)</strong>。<strong>星辉</strong>与<strong>魔导</strong>阶段的混合体。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>深渊 (Abyss)</strong>。来自海洋的各类方块。海晶石、远古海晶石（来自<strong>Quark</strong>）……</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>蜜蜂维度 (Bumblezone)</strong>。来自 Bumblezone 维度的各类方块。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>下界 (Nether)</strong>。你能在下界维度找到的矿石和生物。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>末地 (End)</strong>。你能在末地维度找到的矿石和生物。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>全能合一 (All in One)</strong>。所有阶段的混合体！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">在每个阶段中，你可以获得保证生成的方块。例如，你的箱子里可能会直接出现<strong>星辉魔法 (Astral Sorcery)</strong>的第一个收集水晶。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">有兴趣搭建服务器和朋友一起玩吗？</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d3127\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_In_One/BH_AL_PROMO.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用我的代码<strong>all-in-one</strong>，首月可享<strong>75折</strong>（立减25%）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> 我建议为你的服务器<strong>至少分配4GB</strong>内存。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特别感谢</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/squidgyface1478/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Squidgyface1478</a>&nbsp;提供的标志设计！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>得益于<strong>KubeJS</strong>，<strong>植物培育盆 (Botany Pot)</strong> 的生长速度被略微削弱，且部分方块破坏器（例如来自<strong>Botania</strong>的钻孔透镜或来自<strong>Create</strong>的机械钻头）的合成需要消耗末影气。</p>\n<p>得益于<strong>Time Is Up</strong>模组，你探索不同维度的时间受到限制。因此，如果你想获取该维度的所有内容，就需要运用一些技巧。或者干脆只挖掘你的那一块方块即可。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/All_In_One/BH_AL_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>整合包实况视频</strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p><span><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">英语 (English)</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>DanRobzProbz</p>\n<p style=\"align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/?list=PLwXf_GfY5xMAoDKxDZS2pa3-tynnA5un8&listType=playlist&wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>Ector Vynk</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/?list=PLNLFWDBjd1KrxdFJHnkKO3UzRqWmYyqec&listType=playlist&wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">两者的实况都非常精彩。</span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>Create 模组教程视频</strong></span></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/?listType=playlist&list=PLtYeIGFxKzeQ4OKQv3uSnW9mBTnCdcfne&wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>该频道专注于 Create 模组。你可以在这里找到完整的教程以及模组的实用技巧。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>",
